ve sought to block the elevation of Buria, whom officials say Hegseth has openly considered for his next chief of staff following a purge of top aides. Buria, an MV-22 pilot who served in Iraq and Afghanistan, has emerged as a top contender for one of the Pentagon\u2019s most powerful jobs only months after being named as Austin\u2019s junior military aide.\r\n\r\nWhen Hegseth arrived at the Pentagon in January, Buria quickly became close with the former Fox News host and his wife, Jennifer. ", "website": null, "parent_id": null, "primary_ext": "Person", "updated_at": "2026-04-06T03:04:22Z", "start_date": null, "end_date": null, "connected_relationship_ids": "2053302", "connected_category_id": 1, "aliases": ["Ricky Buria"], "types": ["Person", "Public Official"], "extensions": {"Person": {"name_last": "Buria", "name_first": "Ricky", "name_middle": null, "name_prefix": null, "name_suffix": null, "name_nick": null, "birthplace": null, "gender_id": null, "party_id": null, "is_independent": null, "net_worth": null, "name_maiden": null, "nationality": []}}, "tags": []}, "links": {"self": "https://littlesis.org/entities/457019-Ricky_Buria"}}, {"type": "entities", "id": 460195, "attributes": {"id": 460195, "name": "Pentagon Office of Strategic Capital", "blurb": null, "summary": null, "website": null, "parent_id": null, "primary_ext": "Org", "updated_at": "2026-07-06T19:52:48Z", "start_date": null, "end_date": null, "connected_relationship_ids": "2062173", "connected_category_id": 1, "aliases": ["Office of Strategic Capital (OSC)", "Pentagon Office of Strategic Capital"], "types": ["Organization", "Government Body"], "extensions": {"Org": {"name": "Pentagon Office of Strategic Capital", "name_nick": null, "employees": null, "revenue": null, "fedspending_id": null, "lda_registrant_id": null}, "GovernmentBody": {"is_federal": null, "state_id": null, "city": null, "county": null}}, "tags": ["tech", "defence"]}, "links": {"self": "https://littlesis.org/entities/460195-Pentagon